  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/217/551b2c666bc0d98d3b81c76b5beca67f..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">わー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">夏ですね～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いろんな夏曲きくのたのしーー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">このナナヲアカリさんの</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">陽傘って曲ほんとに良かった！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">誰が作ったのかなって見て見たら</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">澤田空海理さんだった！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">澤田さんの新曲の、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">「花火から逃げて」</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">って曲めちゃいいよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">さっきMVも公開されてたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">見ましょう</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/AT2KZtT0c98\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/AT2KZtT0c98\">https://youtu.be/AT2KZtT0c98</a></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そもそもタイトルが良すぎるんだな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">天才だよな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">てかナナヲアカリと結婚したい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">かわいい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">かわいすぎんだろーーーっっ(；ᴗ；)</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
